SUMMARY:Macbeth - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season @ WTW Wadebridge
DESCRIPTION:Macbeth - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (3h 30min)\n\nTwo o
 f opera's most extraordinary artists return to The Met: Live in HD for Ver
 di's thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale of the scheming cou
 ple determined to seize power at any cost.\nBaritone Quinn Kelsey is the 
 Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous ascent to the throne\
 , opposite soprano Lise Davidsen as the power-mad Lady Macbeth\, whose rui
 nous ambition damns them both. Met Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin tak
 es the podium for a penetrating production by Louisa Proske. Rounding out 
 the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso as Macduff and bass-bariton
 e Ryan Speedo Green as Banquo.\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge\n
 Book tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5555/macbeth-royal-
 ballet-opera-2627-season\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.github.io/wtw-c
 inemas/films/macbeth-royal-ballet-opera-26-27-season.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas Wadebridge
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5555/macbeth-royal-ballet-oper
 a-2627-season
SEQUENCE:0
