SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine @ WTW Wadebridge
DESCRIPTION:Wild Horse Nine\n\nShortly before the 1973 Chilean coup\, CIA a
 gents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their
  bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and as the longt
 ime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies\, Chri
 s's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send eve
 ryone's trip to this remote paradise sideways.\n\nFilm release at WTW Cine
 mas Wadebridge\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/558
