SUMMARY:Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Seaso
 n @ WTW Wadebridge
DESCRIPTION:Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 S
 eason (2h 50min)\n\nAt a garden party on a sunny afternoon\, Alice is surp
 rised to see her parents' friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabb
 it. When she follows him down a rabbit hole\, events become curiouser and 
 curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland\, she encounters countless 
 strange creatures. She's swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Heart
 s\, who's on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusio
 n. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream? \nChristopher Wh
 eeldon's Alice's Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in 
 an explosion of colour\, stage magic and inventive\, sophisticated choreog
 raphy. Joby Talbot's score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping
  melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley's
  wildly imaginative\, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry
  to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The 
 Royal Ballet at its best\, bringing together world-class dance with enchan
 ting family entertainment and ingenious music and design.\n\nFilm release 
 at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebrid
 ge/film/5562/alices-adventures-in-wonderland-royal-ballet-opera-2627-seaso
 n\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.github.io/wtw-cinemas/films/alice-s-ad
 ventures-in-wonderland-royal-ballet-opera-26-27-season.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas Wadebridge
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5562/alices-adventures-in-wond
 erland-royal-ballet-opera-2627-season
SEQUENCE:0
